{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"options\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他一向靠自己安排生活。亲近让他心生期待，也让他在意生活是否仍能由自己作主。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他习惯靠自己的安排维持安稳，也很看重自主。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"自我掌控能解释期待中的顾虑，但这种生活习惯是新增的人物设定，听感本身无法证实。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选2\",\n        \"候选6\",\n        \"候选7\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"他能独自把日子过好，却始终渴望有人分享真正重要的感受。想到这种相伴，他便生出温柔的期待。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他能独自生活，却一直渴望与人分享真正重要的感受。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 7,\n      \"why\": \"它把期待解释为长期的情感分享需求，与自我掌控不同，但听感无法确认他确有这种缺口。\",\n      \"uses\": [\n        \"候选12\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"责任总被他摆在前面，个人愿望常常靠后。于是，眼下这份向往格外珍贵，因为它来自他自己的需要。\",\n      \"history\": [\n        \"他习惯先顾责任，把个人愿望放在后面。\"\n      ],\n      \"credibility\": 6,\n      \"why\": \"责任优先能让个人向往显得珍贵，因果清楚，但这一背景在现有材料中没有直接依据。\",\n      \"uses\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1b1a654-b24e-4356-8398-1306b895fdeb", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T014455873526Z", "elapsed_seconds": 168.015, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T01:47:43.912084+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1204e00a9305d624d85c748b449bd5724fdf44a83e62ab89ad9929b5dc8119f3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "brows